# Butler Routes - Zephras Isle rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the eight confirmed rares and the fixed world containers of
# Zephras Isle. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or standalone.
# EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route.
# Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game data (questie-forever);
# respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated.
guide butler-routes-completionist/zephras-isle-rares
title Zephras Isle - Rares & Treasures (Skyborne)
levels 1-12
zone Zephras Isle
race Skyborne
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords zephras, rares, treasures, skyborne, companions
coords live
version 1

